                                                "sense_id": "4761c554-4a31-3c81-91f1-9e6650e792a0",
                                                "text": "2010, WHY A LAY BROTHER?, Franciscan Friars\nThe male branch of the Franciscan family, a community of Lesser Brothers, is made up of men who are both clergy and consecrated laity traditionally called \"lay brothers\"."
                                            }
